{{ define "content" }}
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-8">
    <div>
      <span class="badge">About</span>
      <h1 class="page-title mt-4">About Rising Star</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Rising Star helps students access class notes, subject materials, units,
        chapters, and learning files shared by their teacher.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card space-y-5 text-sm leading-7 text-academic-700">
      <p>
        This website is designed to make classroom materials easier to organize
        and easier for students to find. Notes are arranged by class, semester,
        subject, unit, and chapter so students can quickly reach the material
        they need.
      </p>

      <p>
        Uploaded files are stored securely and delivered through a private file
        proxy. This helps protect the original storage location and keeps the
        platform easier to manage.
      </p>

      <p>
        The goal of this platform is to support learning by giving students a
        clean, simple, and reliable way to access educational notes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
{{ end }}
